WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:46.242
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:46.512 --> 00:48.663
[Woo Jae] [No search results]

3
00:55.722 --> 00:58.961
Three, two, one!

4
00:58.961 --> 00:59.987
Done.

5
00:59.987 --> 01:01.957
Happy New Year, guys!

6
01:02.626 --> 01:04.825
Whatever Woo Jae is wishing for,

7
01:04.825 --> 01:07.036
please make it all come true.

8
01:07.036 --> 01:08.245
Please.

9
01:08.245 --> 01:09.638
Please.

10
01:09.638 --> 01:12.208
If you want me to treat you like a father,

11
01:12.208 --> 01:14.001
don't ever go looking for Mom.

12
01:14.001 --> 01:15.861
I'm warning you.

13
01:22.218 --> 01:25.805
Jung Woo Jae withdrew the deposit for the dormitory and is moving out.

14
01:25.805 --> 01:27.771
He's quitting judo.

15
01:29.350 --> 01:30.601
Where did you go?

16
01:30.601 --> 01:32.402
Jung Woo Jae.

17
01:37.548 --> 01:38.779
[Episode 3]

18
01:56.611 --> 01:58.517
[Best Actress Nominee] [Yoon Ha Na, "I Was There in Your Night"]

19
02:13.342 --> 02:15.312
Again.

20
02:15.312 --> 02:17.134
It's that day again.

21
02:18.607 --> 02:21.819
The same scene plays out again.

22
02:21.819 --> 02:23.565
Except for one person.

23
02:25.740 --> 02:27.528
Thank goodness...

24
02:34.665 --> 02:37.685
Woo Jae isn't here.

25
02:55.909 --> 02:57.519
- Beautiful. - Ha Na!

26
03:32.932 --> 03:37.228
Now it's time to honor the very best in Korean cinema.

27
03:37.228 --> 03:39.271
Best Actress.

28
03:39.271 --> 03:44.109
Presenting the award is last year's winner, actress Lee Hyun Jin.

29
03:46.980 --> 03:49.566
The bastard could get in through here,

30
03:49.566 --> 03:51.853
here... or here.

31
03:51.853 --> 03:55.496
I've got security by the green room, so no one notices you're gone.

32
03:55.496 --> 03:58.123
This is the route he escaped through.

33
03:58.123 --> 04:00.513
I had guards posted here too.

34
04:01.794 --> 04:04.079
Don't go anywhere near the green room.

35
04:04.079 --> 04:05.756
After the ceremony, go straight to the car.

36
04:05.756 --> 04:07.254
Got it?

37
04:07.841 --> 04:09.221
Yeah.

38
04:15.015 --> 04:17.852
Hello, I'm actress Lee Hyun Jin.

39
04:17.852 --> 04:19.813
- Hello. - Hello.

40
04:27.097 --> 04:29.935
[Actress Yoon Ha Na]

41
04:33.826 --> 04:36.036
The awards are tomorrow.

42
04:36.036 --> 04:39.623
That guy will show up.

43
04:39.623 --> 04:42.126
Woo Jae has to be alive somewhere.

44
04:42.126 --> 04:45.754
Tomorrow, we catch him and go find Woo Jae.

45
04:45.754 --> 04:49.425
The 30th Baekryong Film Awards, 2026.

46
04:49.425 --> 04:51.302
And the award for Best Actress goes to...

47
04:51.302 --> 04:54.680
Yoon Ha Na, from "I Was There in Your Night."

48
04:54.680 --> 04:56.436
Congratulations.

49
05:02.729 --> 05:05.027
- Congratulations. - Congratulations.

50
05:09.271 --> 05:11.405
Feeling that bad?

51
05:11.405 --> 05:12.740
Want to go backstage?

52
05:12.740 --> 05:14.074
No, I'm okay.

53
05:14.074 --> 05:15.985
I'll go to the car.

54
05:20.456 --> 05:21.488
- Hey. - Yeah?

55
05:21.488 --> 05:23.669
Did I ever introduce you to CEO Kim?

56
05:23.669 --> 05:25.085
Oh, is he here?

57
05:25.085 --> 05:26.879
- Where? - He said he would be upstairs.

58
05:26.879 --> 05:29.256
- I see. - He's with Producer Im.

59
05:29.256 --> 05:30.502
Yeah?

60
05:44.855 --> 05:46.502
Bye.

61
05:49.360 --> 05:51.056
You can leave it here.

62
06:08.504 --> 06:09.553
Delivery.

63
06:09.553 --> 06:11.215
[Congratulations, Yoon Ha Na]

64
06:11.215 --> 06:12.925
When did this arrive?

65
06:12.925 --> 06:15.539
- Just now. - The delivery guy?

66
06:15.539 --> 06:17.731
He just went around that corner.

67
06:31.994 --> 06:33.160
[Elevator to Underground Parking]

68
06:42.363 --> 06:45.102
- Great job today. - You too.

69
07:02.494 --> 07:03.934
Excuse me!

70
07:04.899 --> 07:06.812
Wait.

71
07:06.812 --> 07:09.880
You delivered flowers to Ms. Yoon, right?

72
07:10.889 --> 07:13.268
Did you deliver them?

73
07:13.986 --> 07:15.864
Answer me, asshole!

74
07:15.864 --> 07:17.644
Answer me!

75
07:23.537 --> 07:25.989
Excuse me! Over here!

76
07:33.676 --> 07:35.704
Got you, bastard.

77
07:35.704 --> 07:37.462
Who are you...

78
07:53.774 --> 07:55.074
[Transfer]

79
07:55.074 --> 07:56.461
[Transfer to Real Love Capital Complete]

80
08:04.953 --> 08:06.406
Yeah.

81
08:06.406 --> 08:07.970
I sent it.

82
08:08.575 --> 08:11.794
Look at you. So diligent.

83
08:11.794 --> 08:13.853
Yeah. This is how you pay it back.

84
08:13.853 --> 08:15.661
Good job.

85
08:16.256 --> 08:18.550
Hello? Hey!

86
08:18.550 --> 08:19.885
Who am I talking to here?

87
08:19.885 --> 08:21.937
- A little... - He hung up.

88
08:29.645 --> 08:30.729
Careful.

89
08:30.729 --> 08:31.897
This looks so good.

90
08:31.897 --> 08:33.941
Tomorrow's Baekryong Best Actress nominees...

91
08:33.941 --> 08:37.653
- Did you see them? - My money's on Yoon Ha Na.

92
08:37.653 --> 08:39.593
Ha Na in "I Was There in Your Night..."

93
08:39.593 --> 08:42.199
At the end, she's eating alone, then zones out...

94
08:42.199 --> 08:44.535
and the tears just start falling.

95
08:44.535 --> 08:46.745
I bawled my eyes out.

96
08:46.745 --> 08:48.789
She really is good.

97
08:48.789 --> 08:52.751
Looks. Acting. She's got it all.

98
08:52.751 --> 08:56.338
But I heard she's been slipping lately.

99
08:56.338 --> 08:58.257
Like she's just faking it.

100
08:58.257 --> 09:00.926
They say there's no emotion left in her acting,

101
09:00.926 --> 09:02.757
just technique.

102
09:04.513 --> 09:06.553
Maybe she's past her prime.

103
09:06.553 --> 09:08.642
No way. I like her.

104
09:08.642 --> 09:10.687
Man, that sucks for her.

105
09:12.479 --> 09:14.773
Who's prettier, me or Yoon Ha Na?

106
09:14.773 --> 09:16.452
You, obviously.

107
09:17.067 --> 09:19.444
Want ice cream? I'll get some.

108
09:19.444 --> 09:20.879
Strawberry.

109
09:25.935 --> 09:27.642
[Congratulations, Yoon Ha Na]

110
09:29.441 --> 09:31.580
Goodbye.

111
09:42.050 --> 09:43.594
Ha Na.

112
09:43.594 --> 09:45.888
You did it.

113
09:45.888 --> 09:47.449
Congratulations.

114
09:54.771 --> 09:55.898
What...

115
09:55.898 --> 09:57.263
Jung Woo Jae?

116
09:57.263 --> 09:58.849
Yoon Ha Ru.

117
10:00.611 --> 10:02.257
Woo Jae.

118
10:06.366 --> 10:08.702
Wait, don't get out...

119
10:08.702 --> 10:10.468
Woo Jae!

120
10:23.217 --> 10:24.905
Ha Na.

121
11:34.069 --> 11:35.111
Woo Jae...

122
11:35.111 --> 11:36.491
Woo Jae!

123
11:39.616 --> 11:41.063
- Emergency services? - Woo Jae!

124
11:41.063 --> 11:43.255
- Woo Jae! - Monera Hall, basement garage.

125
11:43.255 --> 11:45.090
- He's bleeding. - Woo Jae!

126
11:45.090 --> 11:46.958
- No... - Please hurry!

127
12:06.528 --> 12:07.446
- Please hurry! - Oh my!

128
12:07.446 --> 12:08.613
- Woo Jae... - He's bleeding!

129
12:08.613 --> 12:10.278
No...

130
12:24.379 --> 12:27.360
- I'm sorry! - Hey! Are you crazy?

131
12:42.305 --> 12:43.506
Woo Jae.

132
12:43.506 --> 12:45.524
Stay with me.

133
12:47.527 --> 12:49.780
No...

134
12:49.780 --> 12:51.533
Woo Jae.

135
12:54.623 --> 12:56.257
Ha Na.

136
13:05.128 --> 13:06.380
No, Woo Jae.

137
13:06.380 --> 13:07.888
No!

138
13:09.641 --> 13:11.718
Thank goodness...

139
13:11.718 --> 13:12.928
No.

140
13:12.928 --> 13:15.385
No way...

141
13:23.455 --> 13:25.081
Woo Jae...

142
13:27.312 --> 13:29.786
No!

143
13:33.428 --> 13:35.454
No!

144
14:38.955 --> 14:40.565
In other news.

145
14:40.565 --> 14:43.759
At Monera Hall's basement garage, where the Baekryong Film Awards were held,

146
14:43.759 --> 14:47.814
a man in his 30s was stabbed to death.

147
14:47.814 --> 14:50.108
The victim was a flower deliveryman

148
14:50.108 --> 14:52.986
who was reportedly attacked at the scene.

149
14:52.986 --> 14:57.407
Actress Yoon Ha Na was also confirmed to be at the scene.

150
14:57.407 --> 15:00.535
Police suspect the attack was premeditated

151
15:00.535 --> 15:03.413
and are reviewing CCTV footage and witness statements

152
15:03.413 --> 15:05.290
as the investigation continues.

153
15:05.290 --> 15:09.951
Yoon Ha Na is reportedly in a state of shock.

154
15:47.573 --> 15:49.459
Yoon Ha Na.

155
15:49.459 --> 15:51.378
This is no time to sit around.

156
15:51.378 --> 15:53.585
You're not going to save him?

157
15:57.759 --> 15:59.553
Hey, Yoon Ha Na.

158
15:59.553 --> 16:01.263
We don't have time for this.

159
16:01.263 --> 16:03.723
It got worse.

160
16:03.723 --> 16:05.850
For over 15 years,

161
16:05.850 --> 16:08.995
he lived apart from us, all alone.

162
16:09.813 --> 16:13.306
He endured all that time by himself.

163
16:13.306 --> 16:14.840
And then...

164
16:15.433 --> 16:17.381
because of me again...

165
16:18.238 --> 16:19.489
He died because of me again.

166
16:19.489 --> 16:22.409
He died right in front of me, trying to save me.

167
16:22.409 --> 16:27.372
And you want me to go back to where he is alive?

168
16:27.372 --> 16:30.526
What can we even do if we go back?

169
16:36.923 --> 16:38.470
So?

170
16:38.470 --> 16:39.491
What?

171
16:39.491 --> 16:40.719
So...

172
16:40.719 --> 16:43.471
you won't save Woo Jae?

173
16:43.471 --> 16:44.845
I...

174
16:46.924 --> 16:49.577
I'm scared, Ha Ru.

175
16:51.354 --> 16:54.460
What if I lose him again?

176
16:55.150 --> 16:57.386
I'm terrified.

177
17:06.244 --> 17:07.996
I know.

178
17:07.996 --> 17:09.640
I know, but...

179
17:10.287 --> 17:12.118
not this time.

180
17:12.745 --> 17:14.669
This time is different.

181
17:14.669 --> 17:16.624
Jung Woo Jae...

182
17:17.756 --> 17:19.869
We can save him.

183
17:23.752 --> 17:25.758
What is this?

184
17:26.513 --> 17:30.810
The scar on that bastard's arm.

185
17:30.810 --> 17:32.088
What?

186
17:35.148 --> 17:38.642
Woo Jae knew about this scar too.

187
17:38.642 --> 17:40.710
What do you mean?

188
17:44.690 --> 17:45.992
What is this?

189
17:45.992 --> 17:48.244
Ha Na's stalker.

190
17:48.244 --> 17:50.372
He has a scar on his wrist.

191
17:50.372 --> 17:52.123
I know I saw it.

192
17:52.123 --> 17:53.500
And...

193
17:53.500 --> 17:56.878
the way that bastard moved screamed judo.

194
17:56.878 --> 17:59.589
He definitely trained.

195
17:59.589 --> 18:00.840
Let's go back.

196
18:00.840 --> 18:02.163
We can find him.

197
18:02.163 --> 18:03.885
What about the loan sharks?

198
18:03.885 --> 18:05.387
And his judo career?

199
18:05.387 --> 18:07.213
Got a plan for those?

200
18:55.353 --> 18:57.223
Are we back?

201
18:58.815 --> 19:00.734
There. All done.

202
19:00.734 --> 19:01.901
Should we sing now?

203
19:01.901 --> 19:03.486
One, two, three, four!

204
19:03.486 --> 19:06.021
- ♪ Happy birthday to you ♪ - This time too...

205
19:06.021 --> 19:08.783
- ♪ Happy birthday to you ♪ - Yeah. I'm Yoon Ha Ru again.

206
19:08.783 --> 19:11.953
♪ Dear Ha Ru and Ha Na ♪

207
19:11.953 --> 19:14.981
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

208
19:15.981 --> 19:17.080
Come on, blow them out.

209
19:17.080 --> 19:18.688
Happy birthday!

210
19:20.160 --> 19:22.079
Happy birthday!

211
19:22.079 --> 19:25.387
You put a lot of work into this, honey.

212
19:25.387 --> 19:26.734
We're here.

213
19:26.734 --> 19:28.678
May 7, 2011.

214
19:28.678 --> 19:30.096
The third video.

215
19:30.096 --> 19:32.682
Our 19th birthday.

216
19:32.682 --> 19:33.683
Okay, let's eat.

217
19:33.683 --> 19:35.727
No, wait!

218
19:35.727 --> 19:39.033
We still have the highlight.

219
19:39.773 --> 19:40.812
All right.

220
19:40.812 --> 19:43.276
And now, for our family's treasures,

221
19:43.276 --> 19:48.239
the twins' 19th birthday celebration show...

222
19:48.239 --> 19:50.649
begins now!

223
19:50.649 --> 19:55.413
♪ Happy birthday, Ha Ru and Ha Na ♪

224
19:55.413 --> 20:00.117
♪ Happy birthday to our treasures ♪

225
20:00.117 --> 20:02.077
♪ Ha Ru and Ha Na... ♪

226
20:02.077 --> 20:03.463
Come on!

227
20:03.463 --> 20:05.430
How old are you?

228
20:05.430 --> 20:07.249
When will you grow up?

229
20:07.249 --> 20:09.640
Look at all that dust.

230
20:10.378 --> 20:12.850
You're ruining my appetite.

231
20:12.850 --> 20:13.854
Wait.

232
20:13.854 --> 20:16.571
I cooked all this. Why are you losing your appetite?

233
20:16.571 --> 20:17.894
I made all of it!

234
20:17.894 --> 20:18.937
Apologize.

235
20:18.937 --> 20:21.272
- Just eat. - Apologize!

236
20:21.272 --> 20:22.690
If you don't apologize now,

237
20:22.690 --> 20:25.527
I can never love you again.

238
20:25.527 --> 20:27.362
Suit yourself.

239
20:27.362 --> 20:28.552
Let's eat!

240
20:28.552 --> 20:30.422
- Thank you. - Thank you.

241
20:34.999 --> 20:37.270
- This is so good. - Yeah.

242
21:17.829 --> 21:20.596
Are you really not going to say anything?

243
21:23.691 --> 21:26.824
Beats me. Do what you want.

244
21:29.799 --> 21:32.418
Dad.

245
21:34.899 --> 21:36.919
You're such a good dancer.

246
21:36.919 --> 21:38.725
Whatever.

247
21:38.725 --> 21:41.394
Someone says I ruin her appetite.

248
21:41.394 --> 21:44.105
Mom secretly loves it. She always acts like that.

249
21:44.105 --> 21:45.875
She's never gotten better at it.

250
21:45.875 --> 21:48.035
If only she were half like you.

251
21:48.035 --> 21:50.149
- Right? - True.

252
21:50.149 --> 21:52.864
Your mom's always been bad at showing it, huh?

253
21:52.864 --> 21:55.742
Mom must have been a saint in a past life.

254
21:55.742 --> 21:56.775
I'm sure of it.

255
21:56.775 --> 21:59.577
How else could she end up with a great husband like you?

256
21:59.577 --> 22:00.994
Right?

257
22:04.469 --> 22:06.389
Want me to get ice cream?

258
22:06.389 --> 22:08.336
- Nougat bar? Walnut? - No.

259
22:08.336 --> 22:10.058
- No, thanks. - Why not?

260
22:10.058 --> 22:11.209
Then what?

261
22:11.209 --> 22:12.449
Red bean bar?

262
22:12.449 --> 22:13.575
Red bean bar?

263
22:13.575 --> 22:16.916
Dad, want a cold bottle of makgeolli instead?

264
22:18.344 --> 22:20.082
Ha Na.

265
22:21.976 --> 22:23.603
Dad?

266
22:23.603 --> 22:26.105
You want ice cream, right?

267
22:26.105 --> 22:27.733
Yeah.

268
22:28.566 --> 22:30.099
Go get it.

269
22:30.099 --> 22:31.819
Hurry.

270
22:31.819 --> 22:34.989
My legs hurt!

271
22:34.989 --> 22:37.668
Could oppa get it for me?

272
22:39.885 --> 22:41.003
Fine.

273
22:41.003 --> 22:42.029
I'll go.

274
22:42.029 --> 22:43.646
Stop the cute act.

275
22:44.979 --> 22:47.225
Watermelon bar for me!

276
22:49.504 --> 22:50.713
Ha Na.

277
22:50.713 --> 22:53.410
You seem a little different.

278
22:55.196 --> 22:56.234
How?

279
22:56.234 --> 22:59.379
A little rougher around the edges?

280
22:59.379 --> 23:00.781
Me?

281
23:25.829 --> 23:27.542
[Dear Ha Na]

282
23:27.542 --> 23:29.197
Woo Jae.

283
23:30.044 --> 23:31.966
Jung Woo Jae.

284
23:56.224 --> 23:57.815
Sweetie.

285
23:57.815 --> 23:59.884
How can you be on your phone all day?

286
23:59.884 --> 24:01.661
Got a boyfriend?

287
24:01.661 --> 24:03.692
Dad, stop snooping!

288
24:03.692 --> 24:04.733
I'm not snooping.

289
24:04.733 --> 24:06.331
What about my privacy?

290
24:06.331 --> 24:08.507
Hey, I bought you that phone.

291
24:08.507 --> 24:09.533
Yoon Ha Ru!

292
24:09.533 --> 24:12.152
Back already?

293
24:12.152 --> 24:13.687
Jung Woo Jae...

294
24:13.687 --> 24:14.953
What?

295
24:14.953 --> 24:17.050
Hey, hey.

296
24:17.050 --> 24:19.177
Hey! Son, daughter!

297
24:19.177 --> 24:22.208
What about my ice cream?

298
24:24.298 --> 24:26.091
Red bean bar!

299
24:39.155 --> 24:40.700
It's Woo Jae!

300
24:41.407 --> 24:42.408
Hey!

301
24:42.408 --> 24:44.832
[Haesol, Namseoul] That's the bus to Seoul.

302
24:44.832 --> 24:46.445
Seoul.

303
24:46.445 --> 24:47.808
Let's go.

304
25:00.709 --> 25:05.085
[Namseoul Bus Terminal]

305
25:12.179 --> 25:14.175
So, we're here.

306
25:14.175 --> 25:15.942
Where do we even find him?

307
25:15.942 --> 25:18.111
Real Love.

308
25:18.111 --> 25:21.004
- What? - Real Love!

309
25:21.004 --> 25:24.071
Why are you so serious about this nonsense?

310
25:24.071 --> 25:25.980
Can you focus?

311
25:27.036 --> 25:29.446
Hey, you two. Mr. Skinny and Mr. Bald.

312
25:29.446 --> 25:30.854
Just who are you guys?

313
25:30.854 --> 25:33.367
I'm not Mr. Bald. I'm Real Love Capital's Department Manager!

314
25:33.367 --> 25:37.724
I'm not Mr. Skinny. I'm the Team Leader of Real Love Capital!

315
25:41.220 --> 25:42.601
[Real Love Capital]

316
25:50.592 --> 25:54.574
I'd like to borrow some money.

317
25:57.556 --> 25:59.871
[Loans Approved Today]

318
26:10.079 --> 26:12.665
Hey, asshole. Read it carefully and fill it out.

319
26:12.665 --> 26:14.136
Don't skip anything.

320
26:14.136 --> 26:15.907
Be honest.

321
26:28.881 --> 26:30.311
What?

322
26:32.164 --> 26:33.594
Here to borrow money?

323
26:33.594 --> 26:34.912
Here to pay it back.

324
26:34.912 --> 26:36.984
What the hell?

325
26:39.284 --> 26:41.071
- Jung Woo Jae! - Jung Woo Jae!

326
26:42.710 --> 26:43.770
Hey.

327
26:43.770 --> 26:45.677
What are you two doing here?

328
26:46.490 --> 26:47.932
Wait.

329
26:48.543 --> 26:51.862
Where have I seen these little punks before?

330
26:51.862 --> 26:53.804
You know me, right?

331
26:53.804 --> 26:56.112
Oh, at Haesol...

332
26:56.112 --> 26:57.210
She almost cracked your skull...

333
26:57.210 --> 27:00.361
I mean, your head, boss.

334
27:05.414 --> 27:08.086
You punk walked right in here yourself?

335
27:08.086 --> 27:09.296
What, old man?

336
27:09.296 --> 27:12.058
Want me to really mess you up today?

337
27:12.058 --> 27:14.378
You little...

338
27:14.378 --> 27:15.561
Hey.

339
27:15.561 --> 27:17.772
Give them a welcome gift.

340
27:17.772 --> 27:19.975
Show them some pain.

341
27:20.974 --> 27:24.118
Kids these days have no fear.

342
27:24.770 --> 27:26.480
What now?

343
27:38.156 --> 27:40.429
These little punks...

344
27:43.153 --> 27:44.667
Hey, asshole!

345
27:44.667 --> 27:47.174
You little punks, how dare you...

346
27:49.452 --> 27:51.125
What the heck...

347
27:59.272 --> 28:01.075
Huh? What?

348
28:01.857 --> 28:03.473
Hey, you!

349
28:08.847 --> 28:10.435
Damn it...

350
28:10.435 --> 28:12.474
- Hey! Grab them! - Yes, boss!

351
28:12.474 --> 28:14.323
What the hell are you doing?

352
28:15.322 --> 28:16.488
You little...

353
28:16.488 --> 28:18.616
Damn high school punks...

354
28:39.437 --> 28:41.458
You bastard!

355
28:47.267 --> 28:49.395
Get over here!

356
29:01.518 --> 29:03.742
- Yoon Ha Ru! - Stay back!

357
29:03.742 --> 29:05.996
I will kill him!

358
29:05.996 --> 29:07.557
Stay back, okay?

359
29:07.557 --> 29:09.041
Stay back!

360
29:09.041 --> 29:10.792
Hey, hold still!

361
29:10.792 --> 29:12.946
Hold still!

362
29:29.010 --> 29:30.620
Darn it.

363
29:38.195 --> 29:40.312
Why'd you have to jump in?

364
29:41.194 --> 29:42.958
What?

365
29:42.958 --> 29:45.369
Why jump in and get hurt?

366
29:47.079 --> 29:48.452
You...

367
29:49.081 --> 29:50.227
What?

368
29:50.227 --> 29:52.406
What about you?

369
29:55.857 --> 29:58.614
Why did you risk your life to save me?

370
29:58.614 --> 29:59.892
Twice.

371
29:59.892 --> 30:01.645
It's my job.

372
30:01.645 --> 30:04.012
Stay out of it.

373
30:04.012 --> 30:05.523
I'll handle this.

374
30:05.523 --> 30:08.202
Ha Ru, get Ha Na out of here.

375
30:08.856 --> 30:11.021
And don't come back.

376
30:14.540 --> 30:18.500
Make sure you get that checked out.

377
30:23.165 --> 30:24.613
Come out.

378
30:39.379 --> 30:41.728
You called us out here just to show us this?

379
30:41.728 --> 30:45.104
If you're keeping growing kids captive, at least feed them.

380
30:45.104 --> 30:47.104
We're still growing.

381
30:48.399 --> 30:51.401
Boss. What about the kids?

382
30:52.610 --> 30:56.064
A three-for-one deal walked right in. Lucky us.

383
30:56.064 --> 30:57.408
The biggest one...

384
30:57.408 --> 31:00.194
strip him down piece by piece and sell him.

385
31:00.194 --> 31:02.053
- "Pieces?" - What?

386
31:02.053 --> 31:04.054
- No way. - His organs?

387
31:04.665 --> 31:06.167
The other one...

388
31:06.167 --> 31:08.702
put him on a boat and get market rate.

389
31:08.702 --> 31:10.329
- "Boat?" - A shrimp boat?

390
31:10.329 --> 31:12.289
And you...

391
31:12.289 --> 31:13.624
Where do you want to end up?

392
31:13.624 --> 31:16.186
There's a factory...

393
31:16.186 --> 31:18.507
and other nice places.

394
31:21.215 --> 31:22.339
What the...

395
31:22.339 --> 31:23.825
Hey!

396
31:23.825 --> 31:25.477
Why so upset?

397
31:28.272 --> 31:30.142
If I pay now?

398
31:30.142 --> 31:32.807
- Pay what? - How much does he owe altogether?

399
31:32.807 --> 31:34.193
I'll pay now.

400
31:34.193 --> 31:35.584
Hey, kid.

401
31:35.584 --> 31:37.907
We hit girls too.

402
31:37.907 --> 31:40.564
Listen up!

403
31:40.564 --> 31:42.486
I'm saying...

404
31:42.486 --> 31:44.442
I'll give you the money.

405
31:48.993 --> 31:50.686
Let's see, then.

406
31:52.804 --> 31:56.583
Principal, 30 million won. Monthly interest, 10.5%.

407
31:56.583 --> 31:59.735
Add the overdue months...

408
31:59.735 --> 32:01.662
plus late fees...

409
32:01.662 --> 32:03.907
That comes to about...

410
32:03.907 --> 32:05.739
860 million.

411
32:07.579 --> 32:09.670
Scared now that you heard the number?

412
32:09.670 --> 32:12.081
- Up 360 million in months? - Big money for kids.

413
32:12.081 --> 32:14.013
These scumbags.

414
32:14.013 --> 32:16.486
- 860 million? - Yeah.

415
32:16.486 --> 32:18.153
Not much.

416
32:18.970 --> 32:20.691
If I take care of this...

417
32:20.691 --> 32:22.822
Then Woo Jae is clear, right?

418
32:22.822 --> 32:25.469
You're talking like you can actually pay.

419
32:25.469 --> 32:29.247
When you grow up, you'd make a great con artist.

420
32:29.247 --> 32:31.375
- Go on, then! - Darn it.

421
32:32.399 --> 32:35.047
- What's that? - Hey, Mr. Skinny?

422
32:35.047 --> 32:37.295
- Put on channel 11. - Okay.

423
32:38.142 --> 32:39.418
"Okay," my ass.

424
32:39.418 --> 32:41.270
If you want your money,

425
32:41.270 --> 32:42.513
how about untying us?

426
32:42.513 --> 32:44.458
Oh, come on.

427
32:44.458 --> 32:46.950
- Go ahead. - For real?

428
32:47.618 --> 32:49.345
Darn it!

429
32:50.245 --> 32:52.358
That hurts!

430
32:52.358 --> 32:54.884
The lottery drawing starts now!

431
32:54.884 --> 32:58.310
860 million, you said.

432
32:58.310 --> 33:00.145
Big talk.

433
33:01.783 --> 33:03.328
All right, let's see.

434
33:03.328 --> 33:05.429
Let's see.

435
33:05.429 --> 33:06.570
The first number is...

436
33:06.570 --> 33:07.607
22.

437
33:07.607 --> 33:09.371
Number 22.

438
33:09.973 --> 33:11.124
Oh, we got one.

439
33:11.124 --> 33:13.076
We got one!

440
33:13.076 --> 33:14.620
- We got it. - We have it.

441
33:14.620 --> 33:16.205
Let's see the second number.

442
33:16.205 --> 33:18.540
34. Number 34.

443
33:18.540 --> 33:22.193
What? We have 34 too, boss.

444
33:23.712 --> 33:26.849
Now, what will the third lucky number be?

445
33:26.849 --> 33:28.534
The third number is...

446
33:28.534 --> 33:30.067
Lucky seven!

447
33:30.067 --> 33:31.270
Number 7.

448
33:31.270 --> 33:32.730
Boss, 7!

449
33:32.730 --> 33:34.645
We have 7 too.

450
33:47.500 --> 33:49.300
[May 6, 2011 Ttotto Winning Numbers]

451
33:57.955 --> 34:02.499
7, 15, 20, 8, 10, bonus 2, 25...

452
34:02.499 --> 34:03.809
You're distracting me!

453
34:03.809 --> 34:06.725
Be quiet! You made me forget.

454
34:08.048 --> 34:10.059
20, 2, 30, 4...

455
34:10.059 --> 34:13.512
7, 15, 20, 8, 10, bonus 2, 25...

456
34:13.512 --> 34:17.444
I'd like to borrow some money.

457
34:19.030 --> 34:21.103
They want us there.

458
34:21.103 --> 34:22.446
- Let's hurry. - Wait.

459
34:22.446 --> 34:23.869
Before that...

460
34:29.286 --> 34:32.265
Hello. I have a favor to ask.

461
34:33.490 --> 34:36.218
We're running out of time. What's he doing?

462
34:36.218 --> 34:39.619
[Lottery Shop]

463
34:39.619 --> 34:41.068
Thank you. Have a nice day.

464
34:41.068 --> 34:42.216
You too.

465
34:42.216 --> 34:43.509
Yes!

466
34:43.509 --> 34:45.751
Am I a genius or what?

467
34:46.506 --> 34:49.136
The final winning number is...

468
35:05.239 --> 35:06.859
Last one.

469
35:09.419 --> 35:11.662
10. Number 10!

470
35:11.662 --> 35:13.185
So close!

471
35:13.795 --> 35:15.816
He said 10!

472
35:15.816 --> 35:17.951
We don't have 10!

473
35:17.951 --> 35:20.655
This isn't it. It doesn't match.

474
35:20.655 --> 35:23.293
- Bonus! - What?

475
35:23.293 --> 35:26.483
And today's bonus number is...

476
35:26.483 --> 35:29.821
2. Number 2.

477
35:29.821 --> 35:31.673
Oh my!

478
35:31.673 --> 35:33.477
Yoon Ha Ru...

479
35:34.217 --> 35:35.930
Then this isn't first prize, huh?

480
35:35.930 --> 35:37.015
It's second prize.

481
35:37.015 --> 35:38.242
Second?

482
35:38.242 --> 35:39.773
Then is this worth 860 million?

483
35:39.773 --> 35:42.637
Boss, not that much.

484
35:42.637 --> 35:45.354
- What is this? - Per ticket...

485
35:45.354 --> 35:47.189
203 million.

486
35:47.189 --> 35:48.477
You think...

487
35:49.149 --> 35:51.221
I only bought one?

488
35:52.147 --> 35:53.832
You little...

489
35:57.199 --> 35:58.475
Write an agreement.

490
35:58.475 --> 36:00.452
Want me to trash these tickets?

491
36:00.452 --> 36:05.006
Or... sign one paper and take 860 million?

492
36:09.962 --> 36:12.202
Stop! Stop!

493
36:21.805 --> 36:22.925
[Certificate of Full Debt Repayment]

494
36:40.882 --> 36:42.182
The seal.

495
36:45.255 --> 36:46.993
Bring the seal.

496
36:46.993 --> 36:48.694
Yes, boss.

497
36:52.888 --> 36:54.403
Here it is.

498
36:54.403 --> 36:56.975
We're getting this notarized, so cooperate.

499
36:56.975 --> 36:58.735
Okay.

500
37:02.442 --> 37:04.102
This is insane.

501
37:15.828 --> 37:17.562
Bye!

502
37:25.287 --> 37:27.077
Who are you two?

503
37:32.101 --> 37:34.132
How much do you know?

504
37:36.590 --> 37:38.382
We'll explain later.

505
37:38.382 --> 37:40.247
Don't do this again.

506
37:42.287 --> 37:43.847
It's my life.

507
37:43.847 --> 37:45.695
I'll handle it.

508
37:47.768 --> 37:49.521
What you did today...

509
37:49.521 --> 37:52.108
I will pay you back.

510
37:53.357 --> 37:55.733
Don't look for me again...

511
37:59.663 --> 38:01.533
You jerk.

512
38:02.431 --> 38:04.331
What?

513
38:04.331 --> 38:06.383
Would you have done that?

514
38:06.383 --> 38:09.329
If I were in the same situation, would you?

515
38:09.329 --> 38:13.533
Would you have said, "It's your life. Deal with it yourself?"

516
38:16.088 --> 38:17.988
No, you wouldn't.

517
38:20.151 --> 38:21.631
You jerk...

518
38:23.595 --> 38:26.068
You're such a bastard.

519
38:35.264 --> 38:36.957
Hey...

520
38:54.890 --> 38:56.541
- Jung Woo Jae. - Yeah?

521
38:56.541 --> 38:58.250
What's your dream?

522
38:58.847 --> 39:00.290
My dream?

523
39:01.964 --> 39:03.573
To be a judo player.

524
39:03.573 --> 39:06.563
Maybe I'll make the national team someday.

525
39:08.847 --> 39:10.512
And after you achieve it?

526
39:10.512 --> 39:12.388
Then what would you do?

527
39:15.350 --> 39:16.728
I don't know.

528
39:16.728 --> 39:19.141
Nothing in particular.

529
39:19.141 --> 39:20.743
Boring.

530
39:22.496 --> 39:24.960
Jung Woo Jae.

531
39:25.574 --> 39:28.660
You'll be all over the news someday, right?

532
39:28.660 --> 39:31.120
"Korea's national team judo player, Jung Woo Jae!

533
39:31.120 --> 39:34.485
World number one in judo, takes home the gold!

534
39:34.485 --> 39:35.626
Congratulations!

535
39:35.626 --> 39:38.001
Any words for everyone?"

536
39:38.001 --> 39:39.995
Come on.

537
39:42.360 --> 39:45.842
When that happens...

538
39:45.842 --> 39:48.361
what would you want most?

539
40:35.337 --> 40:37.196
Jung Woo Jae.

540
40:39.383 --> 40:40.782
What?

541
40:40.782 --> 40:41.887
Jung Woo Jae.

542
40:41.887 --> 40:43.287
What's your dream?

543
40:43.287 --> 40:45.082
My dream? To be a judo player.

544
40:45.082 --> 40:48.243
Maybe I'll make the national team someday.

545
40:51.219 --> 40:52.651
Why?

546
40:54.785 --> 40:57.483
You said you'd pay me back for today, right?

547
40:58.542 --> 41:00.643
Then do it properly.

548
41:00.643 --> 41:02.659
Don't do it halfway.

549
41:06.641 --> 41:08.294
Make the national team.

550
41:08.294 --> 41:10.049
Win gold.

551
41:11.588 --> 41:13.673
- What? - Go back to judo.

552
41:13.673 --> 41:16.666
And make the national team.

553
41:16.666 --> 41:19.371
Make everyone want to protect you.

554
41:19.371 --> 41:21.622
Live knowing you're that loved.

555
41:21.622 --> 41:23.496
That's how you pay me back.

556
41:32.204 --> 41:34.231
Yoon Ha Ru, I...

557
41:34.231 --> 41:37.464
Just do it! No matter what.

558
41:37.464 --> 41:39.249
It's your dream.

559
41:39.249 --> 41:41.529
Say you'll do it. Please.

560
41:41.529 --> 41:43.082
Please.

561
41:45.198 --> 41:46.719
Okay.

562
41:48.063 --> 41:49.841
I'll do it again.

563
41:49.841 --> 41:51.247
Judo.

564
41:55.025 --> 41:56.564
You promised.

565
41:57.241 --> 41:58.800
Okay?

566
42:00.227 --> 42:01.582
Yeah.

567
42:07.170 --> 42:09.381
He said he'll do it.

568
42:09.381 --> 42:11.034
Let's go!

569
42:11.034 --> 42:13.125
I'm starving. What should we eat?

570
42:13.125 --> 42:15.293
- Pork cutlet? - I don't eat fried food.

571
42:15.293 --> 42:17.212
- Tteokbokki? - I don't eat carbs.

572
42:17.212 --> 42:19.924
- You eat them all the time. - When do I?

573
42:24.330 --> 42:26.880
If we don't make the national team,

574
42:26.880 --> 42:29.096
we have no future!

575
42:29.096 --> 42:31.155
- No future. - No future.

576
42:31.155 --> 42:32.723
Louder!

577
42:32.723 --> 42:33.762
Got it?

578
42:33.762 --> 42:35.444
- Yes! - Yes!

579
42:36.969 --> 42:39.602
What are you doing here instead of studying?

580
42:39.602 --> 42:41.775
I'm actually pretty good at school.

581
42:41.775 --> 42:43.071
Aren't I?

582
42:43.071 --> 42:44.088
I think so.

583
42:44.088 --> 42:47.200
Come on. You only did judo too.

584
42:47.200 --> 42:48.462
True.

585
42:48.462 --> 42:50.787
I didn't study, but I was smart.

586
42:50.787 --> 42:52.696
Of course.

587
42:54.801 --> 42:56.076
Woo Jae.

588
42:56.076 --> 42:57.352
Training starts now.

589
42:57.352 --> 42:59.121
But the dorm will take a few days.

590
42:59.121 --> 43:01.397
Stay at Ha Ru's place until then.

591
43:01.397 --> 43:03.453
No problem!

592
43:05.201 --> 43:06.753
He's here.

593
43:06.753 --> 43:08.380
- Hello! - Hello!

594
43:08.380 --> 43:09.698
Let's start.

595
43:09.698 --> 43:11.049
Yes!

596
43:11.049 --> 43:13.929
So... our ace, Woo Jae, is back.

597
43:13.929 --> 43:16.096
And our dark horse, Yoon Ha Ru.

598
43:16.096 --> 43:17.820
Enjoy this hell.

599
43:17.820 --> 43:20.716
Whoever endures makes the national team.

600
43:20.716 --> 43:22.060
Training starts!

601
43:22.060 --> 43:24.029
- Yes! - Yes!

602
43:31.935 --> 43:37.334
- Woo Jae! - Woo Jae!

603
43:58.939 --> 44:01.191
Soo Hyuk, keep up!

604
44:01.191 --> 44:03.032
Soo Hyuk, keep up!

605
44:04.527 --> 44:05.862
Han Soo Hyuk!

606
44:05.862 --> 44:07.220
Move!

607
44:07.822 --> 44:08.990
Run faster!

608
44:08.990 --> 44:10.562
Push him from behind!

609
44:31.012 --> 44:32.677
Good! Push-ups!

610
44:34.508 --> 44:35.952
Yoon Ha Ru!

611
44:35.952 --> 44:38.002
Get your head in the game!

612
45:00.211 --> 45:02.764
Judo has its perks.

613
45:11.553 --> 45:12.721
Okay!

614
45:13.479 --> 45:15.265
Switch!

615
45:15.265 --> 45:16.746
Switch!

616
45:32.191 --> 45:33.509
What now?

617
45:34.735 --> 45:36.310
Let me rest.

618
45:37.989 --> 45:39.289
Hey!

619
45:39.289 --> 45:40.556
Go, go.

620
45:43.787 --> 45:45.828
With your left hand...

621
45:45.828 --> 45:47.005
Grab here...

622
45:47.005 --> 45:48.715
Grab.

623
45:48.715 --> 45:50.133
Like this?

624
45:50.133 --> 45:52.205
How do you do this?

625
45:55.925 --> 45:57.883
I got it like this.

626
45:57.883 --> 45:59.586
Hold it like this.

627
46:01.845 --> 46:03.369
Like this?

628
46:07.518 --> 46:09.369
Jeez...

629
46:10.348 --> 46:12.837
How am I supposed to do this?

630
46:31.045 --> 46:32.478
What are you doing?

631
46:47.901 --> 46:49.526
You okay?

632
46:50.780 --> 46:52.105
Yeah.

633
46:55.368 --> 46:57.151
I'll do it for you.

634
47:09.786 --> 47:11.339
Oh my!

635
47:58.313 --> 48:00.100
What?

636
48:29.447 --> 48:30.958
What?

637
49:01.326 --> 49:04.128
Oh, that hit the spot.

638
49:04.128 --> 49:05.828
I'm stuffed.

639
49:06.532 --> 49:08.442
Oh, one left.

640
49:14.777 --> 49:16.777
What's wrong with you?

641
49:18.132 --> 49:21.060
Just give it... to Ha Na.

642
49:21.851 --> 49:24.063
Come on, she's already had plenty.

643
49:24.063 --> 49:26.633
I barely got any.

644
49:26.633 --> 49:29.094
Here, Ha Na.

645
49:29.094 --> 49:31.861
Thanks, Woo Jae.

646
49:35.291 --> 49:37.094
This is so good.

647
49:37.094 --> 49:38.432
Hey, Jung Woo Jae.

648
49:38.432 --> 49:39.521
Here.

649
49:39.521 --> 49:40.807
Eat.

650
49:43.495 --> 49:45.110
That was so good.

651
49:45.110 --> 49:46.250
I'm stuffed.

652
49:46.250 --> 49:48.396
So full.

653
49:49.573 --> 49:51.739
Did I eat all of it?

654
50:04.097 --> 50:05.915
What do I do?

655
50:05.915 --> 50:07.893
How do I share a room with him?

656
50:07.893 --> 50:09.486
Then with me?

657
50:09.486 --> 50:12.937
"Woo Jae, sleep with me. Come to my room."

658
50:12.937 --> 50:14.160
Like this?

659
50:14.160 --> 50:15.519
No.

660
50:15.519 --> 50:19.895
If you do anything weird to Woo Jae while you're in my body...

661
50:19.895 --> 50:21.563
Are you insane?

662
50:21.563 --> 50:22.989
How can you even say that?

663
50:22.989 --> 50:24.494
But you know...

664
50:24.494 --> 50:27.767
It's just sleeping, but you keep thinking weird things,

665
50:27.767 --> 50:30.054
so I got nervous too.

666
50:40.788 --> 50:42.251
Move.

667
51:03.455 --> 51:04.953
Asleep?

668
51:21.531 --> 51:23.562
This is weird.

669
51:23.562 --> 51:25.619
This is really weird.

670
51:29.736 --> 51:32.526
Oh, that hit the spot.

671
51:34.174 --> 51:38.149
What's gotten into those two lately?

672
51:41.837 --> 51:44.160
I'm losing it.

673
52:31.996 --> 52:34.276
What did you wish for?

674
52:34.276 --> 52:36.372
The national team trial is being held this year.

675
52:36.372 --> 52:39.498
I want to make it on the team with you, Yoon Ha Ru.

676
52:57.444 --> 52:58.611
Like this...

677
52:58.611 --> 52:59.977
Grab like this...

678
52:59.977 --> 53:01.450
And then...

679
53:11.989 --> 53:13.768
- Morning. - Yeah.

680
53:13.768 --> 53:15.235
Morning.

681
53:31.670 --> 53:32.818
[National Team Trials: D-23]

682
53:32.818 --> 53:33.922
Faster.

683
53:33.922 --> 53:35.048
Do it right.

684
53:35.048 --> 53:36.261
Good.

685
53:36.261 --> 53:37.574
Go!

686
53:37.574 --> 53:38.927
One more!

687
53:40.549 --> 53:42.897
Ha Ru, you're too slow.

688
53:42.897 --> 53:44.398
Faster!

689
53:44.398 --> 53:45.525
Vroom, vroom.

690
53:45.525 --> 53:46.884
Beep, beep.

691
53:49.905 --> 53:52.329
Han Soo Hyuk, get it together!

692
53:55.808 --> 53:57.972
That's it. Good.

693
54:04.769 --> 54:07.353
Do it right. Focus!

694
54:08.180 --> 54:09.882
Not bad.

695
54:09.882 --> 54:11.133
When you do it...

696
54:11.133 --> 54:14.095
Grip here, control the arm, and bring your hips in.

697
54:14.095 --> 54:15.600
Pull the arm this way.

698
54:15.600 --> 54:18.819
Once you're tight, go in.

699
54:18.819 --> 54:20.017
Pull harder.

700
54:20.017 --> 54:21.048
Try it.

701
54:21.048 --> 54:22.370
Grab.

702
54:22.370 --> 54:23.396
And then...

703
54:23.396 --> 54:24.772
Like this, then step in.

704
54:24.772 --> 54:26.438
Bring your hips in. Good.

705
54:26.438 --> 54:27.770
One more.

706
54:27.770 --> 54:29.318
Good. Smooth...

707
54:29.318 --> 54:31.240
Start from this position...

708
54:33.982 --> 54:36.423
Come out. Come out.

709
54:36.423 --> 54:37.623
Out!

710
54:42.023 --> 54:44.089
That's it. Okay.

711
54:44.089 --> 54:44.929
- Got it? - Yeah.

712
54:44.929 --> 54:46.294
You're doing well.

713
54:46.294 --> 54:48.219
You've definitely improved since before.

714
54:48.219 --> 54:49.837
Thank you.

715
54:58.681 --> 55:00.163
Ha Ru!

716
55:01.473 --> 55:03.972
Aren't you eating?

717
55:03.972 --> 55:05.021
I'm good.

718
55:05.021 --> 55:06.774
Go ahead without me.

719
55:07.648 --> 55:08.733
Hey.

720
55:08.733 --> 55:10.860
You sure you don't need to eat?

721
55:10.860 --> 55:12.904
Yeah, I'm really fine.

722
55:12.904 --> 55:14.233
Okay.

723
55:14.962 --> 55:16.975
We'll go ahead.

724
55:16.975 --> 55:18.034
Good work.

725
55:18.034 --> 55:19.327
Wait up!

726
55:19.327 --> 55:20.494
Seriously...

727
55:20.494 --> 55:23.748
Going to eat all the good stuff again?

728
55:23.748 --> 55:25.082
You slacked off again?

729
55:25.082 --> 55:26.521
Come on!

730
55:36.093 --> 55:37.955
Hey, let's go.

731
55:37.955 --> 55:39.613
Oh, okay.

732
55:55.410 --> 55:58.042
I want to do something with you.

733
55:58.042 --> 55:59.255
What?

734
55:59.255 --> 56:00.309
What...

735
56:00.309 --> 56:03.030
What do you want to do?

736
56:03.030 --> 56:04.246
Are you crazy?

737
56:04.246 --> 56:08.128
Before class starts, practice with me.

738
56:08.128 --> 56:10.169
Practice?

739
56:10.169 --> 56:11.295
Yeah.

740
56:11.295 --> 56:14.090
Why? Not feeling well?

741
56:14.090 --> 56:15.383
No.

742
56:15.383 --> 56:17.051
Let's practice.

743
56:17.051 --> 56:18.426
Okay.

744
56:19.257 --> 56:21.244
- Let's go. - Yeah.

745
56:26.456 --> 56:28.119
Wait for me.

746
57:37.006 --> 57:39.770
It's my life. I'll handle it.

747
57:41.552 --> 57:42.887
Would you have done that?

748
57:42.887 --> 57:45.890
If I were in the same situation, would you?

749
57:45.890 --> 57:49.998
Would you have said, "It's your life. Deal with it yourself?"

750
57:51.292 --> 57:53.252
I'm throwing you, okay?

751
58:10.255 --> 58:12.412
Hey, Jung Woo Jae.

752
58:13.709 --> 58:15.896
I did it, right?

753
58:17.171 --> 58:18.709
Right?

754
58:24.068 --> 58:26.338
Oh my Gosh!

755
58:26.338 --> 58:28.034
I made it.

756
58:34.181 --> 58:35.863
Jung Woo Jae.

757
58:36.914 --> 58:39.110
Get up.

758
58:39.110 --> 58:40.933
Hurry, get up.

759
58:48.244 --> 58:50.051
Yoon Ha Na?

760
59:15.594 --> 59:18.297
[Epilogue coming up]

761
59:41.197 --> 59:43.007
The one I really like is...

762
59:43.007 --> 59:44.727
You want me to wear this?

763
59:44.727 --> 59:46.059
It's Yoon Ha Na.

764
59:46.800 --> 59:48.697
Private Yoon Ha Ru, reporting for duty!

765
59:48.697 --> 59:50.370
Wow, he just...

766
59:50.370 --> 59:52.075
I like you!

767
59:55.216 --> 59:56.883
[Shaman] Let's switch.

768
59:56.883 --> 59:58.540
Our bodies!

769
59:58.540 --> 59:59.678
Ha Na.

770
59:59.678 --> 01:00:03.497
You've got the national team trials coming up.

771
01:00:03.497 --> 01:00:06.983
We came here because of Woo Jae.

772
01:00:13.151 --> 01:00:16.070
[Epilogue]

773
01:00:48.093 --> 01:00:50.928
If you ever don't want to be friends anymore...

774
01:00:51.520 --> 01:00:53.626
just tell me.

775
01:00:54.713 --> 01:00:56.828
What's that supposed to mean?

776
01:01:00.035 --> 01:01:03.159
If you ever feel like you're falling for me,

777
01:01:03.159 --> 01:01:05.582
don't hold back.

778
01:01:07.112 --> 01:01:09.669
That's never happening, so don't worry.

779
01:01:09.669 --> 01:01:10.754
Get some sleep.

780
01:01:10.754 --> 01:01:12.160
I'm off.

781
01:01:14.495 --> 01:01:15.813
I'm serious.

782
01:01:15.813 --> 01:01:17.753
Don't bottle up your feelings.

783
01:01:17.753 --> 01:01:19.899
You'll make yourself sick.
